## Impact Analysis

### Memory Savings

Case: L=256, G=48
- Before: 128 landmarks → (B, 128, D) memory usage
- After:  48 landmarks  → (B, 48, D) memory usage
- Savings: -62% memory for global attention

### Compute Savings

Global attention complexity: O(L × G × d)
- Before: L × 128 × d FLOPs
- After:  L × 48 × d FLOPs
- Savings: -62% FLOPs for global attention

### Correctness

- Before: Variable landmark count (G to 2.67×G)
- After:  Exact landmark count (always G)
- Improvement: +100% correctness guarantee

