## Edge Cases Handled

✅ L < G: More landmarks than positions
✅ L == G: Equal landmarks and positions
✅ L == G+1: One more position than landmarks
✅ L == 2*G: Exactly double
✅ L == 1: Minimal sequence
✅ G == 1: Single landmark

